    "title": "Large print Bible in english",
    "description": "Welcome to free Large Print Bible, the app designed to help those who struggle with small print Bibles. With our app, you can enjoy the King James Version of the Bible in modern and updated language and large fonts, making it easier to read and engage with the God Scriptures.\r\n\r\nOur user-friendly interface makes navigating the Old and New Testaments a breeze. Finding your favorite verses or passages is quick and simple, and our app includes offline audio features, allowing you to listen to your preferred verses if reading is challenging.\r\n\r\nThe Large Print Bible app free is ideal for anyone who wants to access the Bible offline. You can use it anytime and anywhere, making it a convenient option for those living in areas with limited internet connectivity or those who prefer to read in peaceful settings.\r\n\r\nWe understand that access to the Bible should be available to everyone, regardless of their financial situation. That's why our app is entirely free! You can search for verses, bookmark them, and highlight them to refer back to later or share with others. It's a great tool for individuals or Bible study groups.\r\n\r\nThe Large Print Bible app is an accessible and enjoyable way to engage with the Bible. With its updated King James Version, large fonts, and audio features, our app is ideal for those who find small print Bibles challenging or prefer to listen to the Scriptures. Try Large Print Bible today and discover the joy of reading the Bible in a way that works best for you. Best of all, it's free!\r\n\r\nOur application allows you:\r\n\r\n-Read the Bible in large print format\r\n-Enjoy a completely new and user friendly interface\r\n-Use the app without Internet connection\r\n-Adjust text size to read easier\r\n-Copy and paste the passages you like \r\n\r\nThe easiest way to read the Bible: The Holy Scriptures in large print format!\r\n\r\nDownload the complete Bible in English, divided into two major sections: The Old and the New Testament.\r\n\r\nThe Old Testament has 39 books and more than 23.000 verses: Genesis, Exodus, Leviticus, Numbers, Deuteronomy, Joshua, Judges, Ruth, 1 Samuel, 2 Samuel, 1 Kings, 2 Kings, 1 Chronicles, 2 Chronicles, Ezra, Nehemiah, Esther, Job, Psalms, Proverbs, Ecclesiastes, Song of Solomon, Isaiah, Jeremiah, Lamentations, Ezekiel, Daniel, Hosea, Joel, Amos, Obadiah, Jonah, Micah, Nahum, Habakkuk, Zephaniah, Haggai, Zechariah, Malachi. \r\n\r\nThe New Testament has 27 books and more than 7900 verses: Matthew, Mark, Luke, John, Acts, Romans, 1 Corinthians, 2 Corinthians, Galatians, Ephesians, Philippians, Colossians, 1 Thessalonians, 2 Thessalonians, 1 Timothy, 2 Timothy, Titus, Philemon, Hebrews, James, 1 Peter, 2 Peter, 1 John, 2 John, 3 John, Jude, Revelation.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to free Large Print Bible, the app designed to help those who struggle with small print Bibles. With our app, you can enjoy the King James Version of the Bible in modern and updated language and large fonts, making it easier to read and engage with the God Scriptures.<br><br>Our user-friendly interface makes navigating the Old and New Testaments a breeze. Finding your favorite verses or passages is quick and simple, and our app includes offline audio features, allowing you to listen to your preferred verses if reading is challenging.<br><br>The Large Print Bible app free is ideal for anyone who wants to access the Bible offline. You can use it anytime and anywhere, making it a convenient option for those living in areas with limited internet connectivity or those who prefer to read in peaceful settings.<br><br>We understand that access to the Bible should be available to everyone, regardless of their financial situation. That&#39;s why our app is entirely free! You can search for verses, bookmark them, and highlight them to refer back to later or share with others. It&#39;s a great tool for individuals or Bible study groups.<br><br>The Large Print Bible app is an accessible and enjoyable way to engage with the Bible. With its updated King James Version, large fonts, and audio features, our app is ideal for those who find small print Bibles challenging or prefer to listen to the Scriptures. Try Large Print Bible today and discover the joy of reading the Bible in a way that works best for you. Best of all, it&#39;s free!<br><br>Our application allows you:<br><br>-Read the Bible in large print format<br>-Enjoy a completely new and user friendly interface<br>-Use the app without Internet connection<br>-Adjust text size to read easier<br>-Copy and paste the passages you like <br><br>The easiest way to read the Bible: The Holy Scriptures in large print format!<br><br>Download the complete Bible in English, divided into two major sections: T